<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-085" chapter-id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son" source-id="s-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son-ws2069101">
  <p id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">長子<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0002" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0004" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">長素</persName>。年七歲，讀論語至「周監於二代」，外祖<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0025" ref="d84_kqu_2g5">何尚之</persName>戲之曰：「耶耶乎文哉。」<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0040" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>即答曰：「草翁風必偃。」少以敏惠見知。及長，篤志好學，官至祕書丞。年二十四，先<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0080" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">景文</persName>卒，諡曰恭世子。子<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangxuan-dual-age-and-son:p001:m0091" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_AA">婼</persName>襲封，齊受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
